# CPZ cmus configuration.
#
# The default q is "quit -i", which asks for confirmation. Inside mc/lf the
# player owns the whole terminal, so q should return to the file manager the
# same way other viewers do.
bind -f common q quit
bind -f common Q quit

# A folder opened from mc/lf is played from the queue and imported into the
# library. Without this, cmus resumes the library after the queue drains and
# replays the album from the clicked track; with it, playback ends with the
# folder.
set play_library=false
